## 🛠️ Development

```bash
git clone https://github.com/your-org/llmreplay
cd llmreplay

# Install with dev deps
pip install -e ".[dev]"

# Run tests
pytest

# Run tests with coverage
pytest --cov=llmreplay --cov-report=term-missing

# Run a specific test file
pytest tests/test_core.py -v

# Build for PyPI
